sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant B as Browser (WASM page)
  participant H as CorrelationHeaderHandler
  participant M as Middleware pipeline
  participant E as ImageAnalysisEndpoints
  participant O as ImageAnalysisOrchestrator
  participant V as IVisionServiceRouter
  participant G as IGenerativeAiService
  participant I as IImageGenerationRouter

  B->>H: PostAsJsonAsync("api/images/analyze")
  H->>H: stamp X-Session-ID (per tab)<br/>+ X-Correlation-ID (per request)
  H->>M: HTTPS, same origin — auth cookie flows
  M->>M: RequestContextMiddleware<br/>echo headers, push Serilog LogContext
  M->>M: RateLimiter "ai-endpoints" — 10/min per user
  M->>M: UseAuthentication → UseAuthorization<br/>FallbackPolicy = RequireAuthenticatedUser
  M->>E: matched endpoint (.RequireAuthorization)
  E->>E: ValidationFilter of ImageAnalysisRequest
  E->>O: AnalyzeAsync(request, ct)
  O->>V: Resolve(modelId).AnalyzeAsync(bytes)
  V-->>O: description + tags + confidence

  alt Mode = MemeGeneration
    O->>G: GenerateMemeCaptionAsync(tags)
    G-->>O: top / bottom caption + tokens
    O->>O: ImageSharpMemeGeneratorService renders PNG
  else Mode = ImageRegeneration
    O->>G: EnhanceDescriptionAsync(description, tags)
    G-->>O: enhanced prompt + tokens
    O->>I: Resolve(modelId).GenerateAsync(prompt)
    I-->>O: image bytes + content type
  end

  O-->>E: ImageAnalysisResponse
  E-->>M: 200 OK (source-gen JSON)
  M-->>B: response + echoed correlation headers
